                <h2>Steps to Salvation</h2>
                <span class="ornament">✦</span>
            </div>
            <p class="section-sub">The way to a new life in Christ — wherever you are, you can come to Him today.</p>

            <ol class="steps">
                <li class="step reveal">
                    <span class="step-num">1</span>
                    <h3>Believe</h3>
                    <p>Believe that Jesus Christ is the Son of God, that He died for your sins and God raised him from the dead on the third day, confess "Jesus is Lord", and allow him to be Lord of your life.</p>
                    <span class="step-ref">Romans 10:9</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step reveal">
                    <span class="step-num">2</span>
                    <h3>Repent</h3>
                    <p>Turn away from sin permanantly, with a sincere heart. Confess your sins to God and turn toward Him. Ask God to help you if you need help repenting.</p>
                    <span class="step-ref">Acts 3:19</span>
                </li>
                <li class="step reveal">
                    <span class="step-num">3</span>
                    <h3>Water Baptism</h3>
                    <p>Get water baptized. "He that believeth and is baptized shall be saved" Mark 16:16 KJV</p>
                    <span class="step-ref">Mark 16:16, Matthew 28:19, and Acts 2:38</span>
                </li>
            </ol>

