                            <p>Read your Bible, if you do not have a physical copy you can download the Holy Bible from YouVersion: <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/bible/id282935706">YouVersion App (Apple)</a> <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.sirma.mobile.bible.android&hl=en-US&pli=1">YouVersion App (Google Play)</a></p>
